OL,3,GNEWSAThe Masked Singer costumes on
OL,4,Adisplay at museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FCostumes from television show The
OL,7,FMasked Singer have gone on display in a
OL,8,Fnew exhibition in Sussex.
OL,10,FMaking the Masked Singer, at Brighton
OL,11,FMuseum, features 24 costumes and seven
OL,12,Fcharacter heads from seven series of
OL,13,Fthe programme.
OL,15,FSome of the outfits on display are
OL,16,FHedgehog, Fox, Tree, Badger, Mushroom,
OL,17,FPigeon, Phoenix, Pufferfish and Dressed
OL,18,FCrab, all worn by celebrity contestants
OL,19,Fon the ITV show.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
