OL,3,GNEWSAThe Masked Singer costumes on
OL,4,Adisplay at museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FTim Simpson, creative director of
OL,7,FPortslade-based Plunge Creations, said
OL,8,Fhe was "thrilled" that fans would get
OL,9,Fthe opportunity to see the costumes up
OL,10,Fclose.
